{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:276932074aab1852","name":"Aid Another","source":{"id":"source:reference-276932074aab1852","title":"Aid Another","revision":17689,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T22:36:18Z","sha256":"9fc4c4915285b3d53994eb907c486e355c1539821cfb53a273af1727eb5ea8d8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=17689","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Aid%20Another&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-276932074aab1852","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can aid an ally's next skill check or attack roll, or you can interfere with an enemy's attacks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Aiding a Skill Check"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can help another character achieve success on their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Check"}," by making the same kind of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Check"}," in a cooperative effort. If you roll a 10 or higher on your check, the character you are helping receives a +2 bonus on their own check. You can't ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Check"}," to Aid Another.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Combat"},", only the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Copilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Copilot","referenceId":"reference:49f5b0e488cfa66c"}," can assist on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks, and only the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Commander","referenceId":"reference:16af7be312e1840b"}," can assist on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," checks. Any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crew Position"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crew_Position"}," can aid any other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Check"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Aiding an Attack Roll"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["In combat, you can Aid Another character's attack by forcing an opponent to avoid your own attacks, making it more difficult for them to avoid your ally. Select an opponent and make an attack against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 10. If you succeed, you grant a +2 bonus on a single ally's next attack roll against that opponent.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Combat"},", you can Aid Another character's attack by providing improved targeting data, or by coordinating that Attack with other Vehicle Actions.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," can grant a +2 bonus on another character's attack roll by making an attack against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 10."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["System Operator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/System_Operator","referenceId":"reference:75f56e8f22b64ca4"}," can grant a +2 bonus on another character's attack roll by making a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Commander","referenceId":"reference:16af7be312e1840b"}," can grant a +2 bonus on another character's attack roll by making a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Tactics)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Tactics)"}," check."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["In ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mass Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mass_Combat"},", you can aid the attack roll of another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," by adding your Battalion's firepower to the attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Field Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Field_Commander","referenceId":"reference:5ad8d1c0fe6dab83"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["First Officer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/First_Officer","referenceId":"reference:54aa9f7df3de3a47"}," can make a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Tactics)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Tactics)"}," check to grant a single adjacent allied ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," a +2 bonus on its next attack roll made before the beginning of the Field Commander's next turn."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["An ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack Leader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_Leader","referenceId":"reference:949951fa3e0c2153"}," selects a target within the range of their Battalion's weapons, and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," makes an attack roll against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 10 (applying all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," penalties as though the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," is attacking the designated target). If this attack is successful, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack Leader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_Leader","referenceId":"reference:949951fa3e0c2153"}," grants a single adjacent allied ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," a +2 bonus on its next attack roll made against that target before the beginning of the Attack Leader's next turn."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Suppressing an Enemy"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["In combat, you can distract or interfere with an opponent, making their attacks more difficult. Select an opponent and make an attack against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 10. If you succeed, that opponent takes a -2 penalty on its next attack roll.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can't use the Aid Another Action to Suppress a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", but you can Suppress an individual ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," (such as the lead ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," for a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Battery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Battery"},").\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mass Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mass_Combat"},", you can suppress the attack of an enemy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," by bombarding the target with fire. An ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack Leader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_Leader","referenceId":"reference:949951fa3e0c2153"}," can select a target within the range of their Battalion's weapons, and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," makes an attack roll against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 10 (applying all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," penalties as though the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," is attacking the designated target). If this attack is successful, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack Leader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_Leader","referenceId":"reference:949951fa3e0c2153"}," causes the target ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," to take a -2 penalty on its next attack roll.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
